{"id":"501792","name":"河鲫鱼豆腐汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/501792/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"河鲫鱼","amount":"1条"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"枸杞","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：河鲫鱼（已洗净）","img":"images/501792/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐","img":"images/501792/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"枸杞（已泡）","img":"images/501792/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"姜片","img":"images/501792/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将豆腐去包装纸倒扣在盘中，用刀划开，待用。","img":"images/501792/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"烧锅倒油烧热，下入河鲫鱼两面煎一下。","img":"images/501792/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"接着，加适量的料酒、姜片和清水。","img":"images/501792/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮开，煮至汤汁有些变白。","img":"images/501792/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后，合入豆腐煮开，加适量的盐、鸡精。","img":"images/501792/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"调味翻匀，出锅。","img":"images/501792/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"撒上泡好的枸杞，即成。","img":"images/501792/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}